            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Alan Turing</strong><br>\nAlan Turing was born on June 23, 1912, in London. From a young age, he showed a talent for mathematics and science, which his family encouraged. Turing attended Sherborne School and later King's College, Cambridge. His teachers recognized his brilliance, particularly in solving complex problems. Despite his talents, Turing's ideas were sometimes ahead of his time, which meant they weren't always understood by his peers.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Academic Contributions</strong><br>\nAfter graduating from Cambridge, Turing published a paper on the concept of algorithms and computation, which would lay the groundwork for modern computing. His most famous academic contribution, the Turing machine, was a theoretical device that he proposed could perform any mathematical computation if it could be represented as an algorithm. This concept has had a lasting impact on the field of computer science.</p>\n\n<p><strong>World War II and Cryptography</strong><br>\nDuring World War II, Turing worked for the Government Code and Cypher School at Bletchley Park, Britain's codebreaking center. He was instrumental in breaking the Enigma code, which was used by German forces to send encrypted messages. Turing's work in developing the Bombe machine, which helped decipher Enigma messages, was crucial to the Allied war effort and is considered one of his greatest achievements.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
